## Component utilities

**Buttons** — Figma: ActionButton (pill), ActionButtonIcon (circle), ActionButtonSection (large pill).
- ActionButton: `btn btn-primary btn-size-200`
- ActionButtonIcon: `btn btn-primary btn-icon btn-size-200` (add `btn-icon-padded` for header-style padding)
- ActionButtonSection: `btn btn-primary btn-section`

See `packages/design-system/src/components/button.css` for full API.

**Links** — Figma: Action Default (https://www.figma.com/design/FlWyqUG6r50kdIZjUQ160i?node-id=4246-184).
- Base: `link`
- Animated underline (reveals on hover): `link link-underline`
- Trim variant (shorter underline): `link link-underline-trim`
- Thick (1.5px for larger sizes): `link link-underline link-underline-thick`
- Combine with typography: `link link-underline title-style1-300 text-content-default-primary`

See `packages/design-system/src/components/link.css` for full API.

